{"version":1,"content":"<p>DeepSeek用户反饋，DeepSeek網頁端和移動端 App 內正灰度測試「顯示本輪消耗額度」功能。用户在完成一輪對話後，界面會彈出詳情頁，展示本次交互消耗的 Token 數量及其對應的估算金額（價格和 API 持平）。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588148.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T04:23:49.861853+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:09:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:17:12.143706+00:00","content_hash":"fb46fc172cf751867ddb952743fb631a88adcf7709751e0567f621e75e26f44e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}